## Architecture layers

```
domain/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/         # Entities + repository interfaces
application/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/    # Use cases (ports)
infrastructure/{{snakeCase moduleName}}/ # Django app (adapters: views, ORM, repo)
```

- **domain/** — Pure domain model. No framework code.
- **application/** — Use cases that express business intent.
- **infrastructure/** — Django apps that implement domain ports. Registered
  in `INSTALLED_APPS`.

